 choices=[('Aluminum and vinyl','Compare the feel, finish, and cleaning requirements of each material. Both appear in the original mini-blind range, but available slat widths and colors depend on the collection. We check the selected product against your window dimensions before ordering.'),('Color and slat width','White, off-white, and gray offer different contrasts with painted trim. Look at the sample both open and closed. Narrow slats create more horizontal lines than wider Venetian blinds, which can change how a small window looks.'),('Lift and tilt controls','Lifting the blind and tilting the slats are different functions. Try the available controls during your consultation, especially if the window sits behind a desk or sofa. Ask about cordless options and whether the bottom rail will be within reach.')],
