 choices=[('Single-cell and double-cell','The number and size of the cells affect the fabric profile. Compare samples against the scale of your window and ask for the specifications of the product being quoted. Energy performance depends on the shade, its fit, the window, and how you use it.'),('Light filtering or room darkening','Light-filtering fabrics soften daylight. Room-darkening options reduce light through the shade, but mounting and edge gaps still matter. Think about morning sun in a bedroom and nighttime privacy in a front-facing living room.'),('Top-down and lift options','Selected systems let you change coverage from the top as well as the bottom. Ask which configurations are available for your dimensions. For high windows or several shades used together, compare manual controls with compatible motorization.')],
