 faq=[('Are composite shutters waterproof?','Do not assume that from the name. Water exposure limits depend on the product and installation location. We check the selected collection before recommending it for a damp area.'),('Can composite shutters cover large windows?','Available panel dimensions and layouts vary. We measure the opening and confirm the manufacturer’s size limits, hardware, and any required panel divisions.'),('Should I choose composite or wood shutters?','Compare the finish you want, room conditions, panel dimensions, weight, and budget. We bring samples and explain the suitable options for your windows.')],
